Name:           portal
Version:        @VERSION@
Release:        1%{?dist}
Summary:        Reach Tailscale devices through RustDesk
License:        MIT
URL:            https://github.com/devinull/portal
Source0:        portal

%description
Portal is a terminal interface for discovering desktop peers on Tailscale and
opening RustDesk desktop or file-transfer sessions.

%install
mkdir -p %{buildroot}/usr/bin
install -m 0755 %{SOURCE0} %{buildroot}/usr/bin/portal

%files
/usr/bin/portal

%changelog
* Thu Aug 13 2026 Portal contributors <devinull@users.noreply.github.com> - @VERSION@-1
- Initial release
